   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. The Finance Assessment in the area of environmental protection and rational use of natural resources (FA) is carried out, the draft report on the FA results and the developed recommendations shared with the Ministry of Natural Resources and Environmental Protection. - 1
2. The final report on the results of the FA in the area of environmental protection and rational use of natural resources is presented at the national level. - 1
3. The BioFin (Biodiversity Finance) methodology is applied, the possibility of implementing the normative budgeting in terms of specially protected natural territories is assessed, the report and developed recommendations are shared with the Ministry of Natural Resources and Environmental Protection. - 1</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. The Finance Assessment in the area of environmental protection and rational use of natural resources (FA) is carried out, the draft report on the FA results and the developed recommendations shared with the Ministry of Natural Resources and Environmental Protection. - 0
2. The final report on the results of the FA in the area of environmental protection and rational use of natural resources is presented at the national level. - 0
3. The BioFin (Biodiversity Finance) methodology is applied, the possibility of implementing the normative budgeting in terms of specially protected natural territories is assessed, the report and developed recommendations are shared with the Ministry of Natural Resources and Environmental Protection. - 0</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Conducting an assessment of the effectiveness of the implementation of State programs from the standpoint of financing the SDGs (RIA), presentation of the methodology and results to national partners.
2. Conducting a DFA study, presenting the methodology to national partners, conducting a series of interviews with various stakeholders.
3. Adaptation of the global BIOFIN methodology in Belarus, study of economic and legal aspects of creating a market for ecosystem services in Belarus</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. 24 State programs were analyzed from the perspective of SDG financing, including SDG 5 Gender. A presentation was made to national partners. The implementation of the RIA methodology is planned for 2023.
2. Work on the implementation of the DFA is underway, a set of interviews with various stakeholders has been conducted, the draft report has been submitted to UNDP.
3. Economic and legal studies on the creation of a market for ecosystem services were transferred to the national partner (Ministry of Natural Resources). The adaptation of the BIOFIN methodology is at the final stage.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Forming and hiring a project team, launching project activities.
2. Hiring a BIOFIN research team.
3. Hiring a RIA research team
4. Conducting a study to determine the position of Belarus in the Global Green Economy Index</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">All goals set have been achieved. The hired project team, with the support of the UNDP office, held a kick-off meeting with the Ministry of Nature as a national partner, laid the foundations for RIA, DFA and BIOFIN. A presentation of the position of Belarus in the GGEI was held, agreements were reached with national partners on the preparation of a national action plan to develop the position of Belarus in the index.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
